# Discord User Token
# How to get (easiest):
# 1. Open Discord in browser/desktop -> press Ctrl+Shift+I -> go to Console tab
# 2. Paste and enter:
#    (w=webpackChunkdiscord_app).push([[Symbol()],{},o=>{try{Object.values(o.c).some(e=>e.exports?.setToken&&(w.t=e.exports.getToken()))}catch{}}]),w.t
# 3. Copy the output token (without quotes) and paste below:
TOKEN=your_discord_token_here
